array['Board Certified Physician Life Care Planners','Practicing physicians specializing in Physical Medicine and Rehabilitation','Full range of life care planning and damages valuation services from a single provider','Standard six-week turnaround with expedited services available','Transparent fixed pricing','Over 90 Board Certified Life Care Planning Physicians and Damages Valuation Experts','ClearView Process designed for quality, value, efficiency, and convenience'],
'Public website positions pricing as transparent, affordable, and fixed, with efficiency from systems and workflow processes.',
array['Nationwide provider headquartered in San Antonio, Texas','Large expert network covering physician life care planners and forensic professionals','Streamlined systems and workflow processes','Case management support for clients','Complimentary continuing legal education for plaintiff and defense counsel'],
array['No public self-disclosed weaknesses found; replace with internal assessment','Public profile emphasizes strengths, so competitive risks should be validated with customer feedback and win/loss data'],
'Attorneys for plaintiff and defense, government agencies, insurance companies, trusts, courts, legal professionals, insurance and claims professionals handling chronically and catastrophically ill or injured individuals.',
